<title>POLAND: Largest Polish brewer issues PLN 8.5 mln CPs.</title>
<headline>Largest Polish brewer issues PLN 8.5 mln CPs.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Poland's largest brewery, Elbrewery Company Ltd., controlled by Australia's Brewpole BV, issued 8.5 million zlotys of commercial papers on Tuesday, issue manager ING Bank NV in Warsaw said in a statement.</p>
<p>The commercial papers, called KWIT, were sold for one- and three-month periods with yields of 18.60 and 18.80 percent respectively.</p>
<p>The sale is part of Elbrewery's 90-million-zloty KWIT-y scheme which began in January 1995.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
